# Scorekeep reads NO secrets, URLs, ports or credentials - it is a local,
# offline, single-user program. This file documents the only environment
# variable it honours, so `cp .env.example .env` changes nothing (Scorekeep
# never loads a .env file; it works with no environment set at all).
#
# Set NO_COLOR to any value to keep output plain text (same as --no-color).
NO_COLOR=
